{
  "name": "Schedule AI captions to social media from a Google Sheets calendar",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule AI captions to social media from a Google Sheets calendar\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Reads the scheduled posts from your content calendar spreadsheet.\n3. Uses OpenAI to write the post copy and parses it into per-platform fields.\n4. Schedules posts to X (Twitter), Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads, and LinkedIn for the date and time you set.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] Connect Google Sheets and select your spreadsheet and sheet.\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n- [ ] Confirm the schedule date in each Publish node, or map it from an upstream field.\n\n### Customization\n\nEdit the prompt in the AI Caption Rewriter node, or change the OpenAI model, to tune the tone of the copy.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 634
      },
      "id": "64eefc87-ee7e-4414-8610-572b838ed815",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
